  <item>
    <title>陆越颖 | 音乐剧编剧的一天</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/653f16be79818ece056a37b0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">653f16be79818ece056a37b0</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 30 Oct 2023 02:36:46 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>小陆是上海土著，自由职业者，给音乐剧广播剧写剧本、作曲，同时还经营一家塔罗牌工作室，才艺多到写不完。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们聊了聊音乐剧的创作、上海正在兴起的小剧场文化，以及给小白入坑音乐剧的一些tips。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="243">4:03</a> 帮朋友写广播剧、给主题曲作词，从此踏入编剧圈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="583">9:43</a> 人生第一部音乐剧改编作品《八角亭迷雾》杀出重围</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="982">16:22</a> 用大IP改编成音乐剧的流程是什么样的?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1522">25:22</a> 浅谈音乐剧的形式、唱段的创作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1897">31:37</a> 已经看过影视剧，为啥还要再看改编的音乐剧？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3260">54:20</a> 编剧的一天是怎样的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3560">59:20</a> 音乐剧有哪些题材？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3992">1:06:32</a> 实用技巧：如何选剧、挑卡司、挑座位、找特价票……</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhxrFGyByhvP5VSy_PvuhOeth717.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fvx9MyjBWBTsV3PvX0wwO_5Lok6c.jpeg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lr4Gohk1sYKesYEmW7BMUBYxkHfY.m4a" length="114059971" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:18:38</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsaqPcLi-KmfUNUfEhImwH43eHyS.jpg"/>
