    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/651bfab450cf691d24086f94</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">651bfab450cf691d24086f94</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 03 Oct 2023 11:27:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>听说这是最后一季，我们绷不住了。趁这件事还没有坐实，想对节目组进行有理有据的表白。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="162">2:42</a> 哪个音综能有这么多好嗑的CP！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1190">19:50</a> 赞美舞美VJ和音响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1877">31:17</a> 赞美后期剪辑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2150">35:50</a> 赞美视觉设计</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2415">40:15</a> 上节目卖周边怎么了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2889">48:09</a> 因乐夏诞生的二次创作：德夏、自乐班等</span></p><span></span><p><span>也想听听乐夏在大家心目中的高光时刻与至暗时刻，欢迎来留言！</span></p>]]></description>
