  <item>
    <title>刘高兴：野生livehouse摄影师养成记</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/634bbf129186d4e4c46a1274</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">634bbf129186d4e4c46a1274</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 16 Oct 2022 08:21:38 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>嘉宾刘高兴，一个非常高能的互联网人，也是合成器玩家、音乐人、业余摄影师。2013年开始带着相机进入livehouse，在他为数不多的朋友圈/微博上你会见到很多熟悉的面孔：南京市民、新裤子、杭天、GALA、Suede、万青、布衣……期间遇到过版权乌龙，也得到不少官方认可，今天把经验和故事一并分享，请搭配照片服用。</span></p><span></span><p><span>*以下照片版权归刘高兴所有</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="189">03:09</a> &nbsp;无心之作火遍全网，成为艺人词条照</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnKzl1y4pTPiqPGQ9W_-txvZc7cR.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmB2OR-dluAewWZVp-pdiD3Jy5Jt.PNG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fto7Mrg_Z9ezncr2lGKUPkB1Avul.PNG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="381">06:21</a> 拍现场像狩猎？为啥只拍黑白的？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhTqdXCPTruxYL2EsATagqvfFUNS.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu9EYZ5AEHZ2oE-MHPX8Jh4T63NF.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqpcAo9P2RFD5saNAfvz0cLoJZWH.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk9wRRdbVqO7XJvQF78dVxYmgBSm.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FspSjIJcMX7qyiEJe5KJ9ZXkqv1o.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn8SVpVJv2H-WUx041Pwhu3V1aR8.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="703">11:43</a> 分享tips：做减法、脸要亮</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="930">15:30</a> 深圳奇葩音乐节的官方摄影经历</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpNOSnRbQA-kb18lEvSQd2kDyvx3.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkI61dEt919z-yTtTpFhcNXuqeBI.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmQsR2nqVVMAJvuoHbLI_toaSWiD.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a> 野生转官摄 ，黑胶换版权</span></p><span></span><p><span>帅大叔满江：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkCojxoRdWgAPoSRSy8sgNcwcpM6.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrYePKCf9EyDYR5IMPQcGu93kbtD.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1530">25:30</a> &nbsp;北京livehouse太苦了！演出新方向：综艺化？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2008">33:28</a> 为啥一定要去看现场？跟听CD比有哪些不同的感受?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2270">37:50</a> &nbsp;甩头怎么拍好看?</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj6ieNAsTzuBwulTrncemc1s9vxp.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnvwCWYz0qbI5_cCWy1oDsk6xH0E.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmZvt8r_HIvY3tuT9Z0CmZujCCp8.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2502">41:42</a> 刘高兴名作《董二千 琴头插烟》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr7J1fWtsroohKkbxlc-EmkFMXDl.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fti-X_UUVLmSio0i18Bl3EsehSsQ.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2854">47:34</a> 滚圈摄影天花板高原</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3110">51:50</a> 如果自己乐队上台想拍成什么样？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjFhwkEdnXraUyyj5Y1IGwOjypyi.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（刘高兴本人）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrlIdz1yqzFFO_GK0QSYR221YGXH.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3333">55:33</a> 有过100场live拍摄经验后，选片（偷懒）有什么窍门？</span></p><span></span><p><span>更多熟悉的面孔：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuO6S0jwPrjl3pD4YVPGlC5WoL2J.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjHnv8S3Fv11dFBuc_PBmK4nQWdJ.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqcSXSS0MI008HZPeWW9R2ajW29U.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk847pyWvMaKz8oM46XOMSvmZS1L.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkcL4WU3tl5_PNhkfcUFcBQ2aWRa.jpeg"></figure>]]></description>
