  <item>
    <title>Dani+小田：如何用业余时间经营一家独立黑胶厂牌？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62af1189f21b8abc99f663a3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62af1189f21b8abc99f663a3</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 19 Jun 2022 12:07:37 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Dani和小田两个人同时经营着多家独立国际音乐厂牌，包括Goatowarex、Viva Angel、迷莲唱片等等，在圈内小有名气。今天我们在仓库里一起打包发货，每天要发出大几百张碟，这一切都是两人在本职工作之外的时间完成的，这到底是咋做到的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="158">2:38</a> Dani的20年厂牌生涯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1088">18:08</a> 从灌碟到发行，需要哪些具体的技能？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1791">29:51</a> 用心做出品，中版唱片的逆袭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2747">45:47</a> 发片周期与怀旧的mixtape</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3426">57:06</a> 乐队给你挖过哪些坑？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3709">1:01:49</a> 黑胶回潮和中国经典金属黑胶厂牌《迷莲》</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM来自小田的乐队：</span><br><span>真吾乐队 - 《风灵 Saluna》《寻 Farewell》《长夜 Beyond the night》《星寂 Fragments》</span></p><span></span><p><span>主营厂牌Goatowarex主页：</span><br><span></span><a href="https://www.goatowarex.com/" data-url="https://www.goatowarex.com/"><span>www.goatowarex.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>（好看且不贵 =）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FqQe9VAe8bQtbkvuKoFrqcel5IUj.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/Fg-pbdP55zJIfXfzVEbq2xk9Ash1.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FqzBtZbY0nDmUYx7VZKVfUnkElGG.jpeg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvg8ne0Xe-qdJxY4jicsvJsTslq7.m4a" length="105893237" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:12:10</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsaqPcLi-KmfUNUfEhImwH43eHyS.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>刘高兴：咸鱼上的二手乐器江湖</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/629347b56c7eec4d0113cb22</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">629347b56c7eec4d0113cb22</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 29 May 2022 10:15:17 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>嘉宾刘高兴，一个非常高能的互联网人，也是合成器玩家、音乐人、业余摄影师，玩咸鱼七八年，买卖超过100件乐器，流水快20w，这其中的快乐，分享给你。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a> 玩合成器到最后就是玩收纳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="800">13:20</a> 奇奇怪怪的打击乐：果壳铃</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="989">16:29</a> 电吉他界的奢侈品：元年琴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1235">20:35</a> 我们是鲁琴（我国山东省是著名的山寨电吉他之乡），一直在努力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1470">24:30</a> 国产做旧师的玄学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1846">30:46</a> 在国外逛中古乐器店</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a> 为什么要拉黑讨价还价的买家</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2390">39:50</a> 与一把半空心做旧贝斯的漫长缘分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2928">48:48</a> 卡祖笛现场表演</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3048">50:48</a> 现在的乐器能有多便携？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3352">55:52</a> 咸鱼买卖Tips总结</span></p><span></span><p><span>*以下图片来自刘高兴</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FldKv5Y-4FZrpyt8Fk8gzqqPg8ih.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FvE-zc2VwqqwwqXAUgMQpMZnnRrX.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FgMlSpY6vxBPUhJhFRl6CIwvkI40.jpeg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqQL2tdB3fBbn2GIGV6AdfdfNevv.m4a" length="84482072" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:58:14</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsaqPcLi-KmfUNUfEhImwH43eHyS.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
